    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On a recent visit to Shanghai, I looked up through some old trees in the heart of the city. I noticed that the sky was not grey but clear and blue. At a busy "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "intersection",
            "zh": "十字路口"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " near the Wukang Building, the scene was quiet. Electric cars sped by almost silently. And along the lively Huaihai Road, tourists and locals walked along sidewalks empty of trash."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After a lifetime of loving Shanghai, even though it was a bit polluted, noisy, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "messy",
            "zh": "肮脏的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", I found myself surprised. It was like "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "I took off my rose-coloured glasses only to discover that the city had actually turned pink"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But the changes aren’t just in the sky and the streets. As the city continues to grow outward, it’s increasingly growing inward as well. In its centre, I found a few new pockets of character."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One of them is the area along Suzhou Creek. For many years, it was home to Shanghai’s industry. In the 1980s, most of those factories moved away, leaving behind broken "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "warehouses",
            "zh": "仓库"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and a polluted waterway. But after years of hard work, the area has completely changed. There is now a beautiful 26-mile riverside path. It serves as a green link between old and new art and cultural sites."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I spent a day biking west along the creek. Along the way, I stopped at Rockbund, a group of historical buildings now filled with art museums, shops, and restaurants. I visited Fotografiska, a home for exciting "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "visual art",
            "zh": "视觉艺术"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I also passed the Shanghai Postal Museum and the historic Sihang Warehouse. It was a long ride, but one I’ll never forget."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My recent exploration of Shanghai gave me a whole new view of the city. I’m even more in love with it now. In fact, I’m already planning my next visit!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
